"use strict";(self.webpackChunktranzila_payment_for_woocommerce_pos_doc=self.webpackChunktranzila_payment_for_woocommerce_pos_doc||[]).push([[104],{20(t,e,a){a.r(e),a.d(e,{_pageData:()=>r,default:()=>o});var n=a(641);const r=JSON.parse('{"path":"/tranzila-payment/features.html","title":"Features Spotlight","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{},"git":{},"filePathRelative":"tranzila-payment/features.md"}'),l={name:"features.md"},o=(0,a(6262).A)(l,[["render",function(t,e,a,r,l,o){return(0,n.uX)(),(0,n.CE)("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[(0,n.Fv)('<h1 id="features-spotlight" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#features-spotlight"><span>Features Spotlight</span></a></h1><p>The <strong>Tranzila Payment for WooCommerce POS</strong> addon provides key features to securely integrate, configure, and manage credit card transactions at physical Point of Sale checkouts. Here is a detailed spotlight on its core capabilities.</p><hr><h2 id="_1-multi-outlet-terminal-configuration" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-multi-outlet-terminal-configuration"><span>1. Multi-Outlet Terminal Configuration</span></a></h2><ul><li><strong>Isolated Outlets Settings:</strong> Define separate payment credentials for each outlet individually under <strong>Point of Sale &gt; Outlets &gt; Edit Outlet</strong>.</li><li><strong>Direct Revenue Routing:</strong> By mapping unique supplier accounts to each outlet, transaction revenue is directly deposited into the correct store bank account.</li><li><strong>Credentials Lock:</strong> Securely store terminal passwords and identifiers to prevent unauthorized tampering by cashiers or clerks.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="_2-advanced-terminal-field-mapping" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-advanced-terminal-field-mapping"><span>2. Advanced Terminal Field Mapping</span></a></h2><p>The plugin supports key terminal configuration fields required by the Tranzila payment gateway:</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Config Field</th><th style="text-align:left;">Purpose / Use Case</th><th style="text-align:left;">Default Values</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>POS ID</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Unique terminal identifier registered with Tranzila</td><td style="text-align:left;">Empty (Must match hardware sticker)</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Supplier Name</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Tranzila account supplier identifier</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>tranzilap</code> (Standard test account)</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Company Name</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Brand name displayed on receipt printouts</td><td style="text-align:left;">Custom text field</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Transaction Mode</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">The explicit transaction mode (A = Standard immediate charge, V = Token capture, N = J2 Verification/Auth, K = Tokenize only)</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>A</code></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Credit Type</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Defines how credit cards are billed (Regular vs. Installments)</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>Regular Credit</code></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="_3-custom-pos-gateway-styling" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-custom-pos-gateway-styling"><span>3. Custom POS Gateway Styling</span></a></h2><ul><li><strong>Custom Titles:</strong> Define a user-friendly label (e.g. &quot;Card Terminal&quot; or &quot;Tranzila Card Reader&quot;) that is clear to cashiers.</li><li><strong>Toggle Status:</strong> Quickly enable or disable the gateway globally from the POS Payment settings panel.</li></ul><blockquote><p>[!IMPORTANT] <strong>WooCommerce POS Dependency:</strong> Tranzila Payment for WooCommerce POS is an <strong>addon extension</strong>. It requires the core <a href="https://wpdoc.webkul.com/pos-for-woocommerce/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">POS for WooCommerce</a> plugin by Webkul to be installed, active, and licensed on your WordPress installation to function.</p></blockquote><blockquote><p>[!Note] This plugin currently supports only <strong>trademode: A</strong> and <strong>credtype: 1</strong> in the Tranzila payment gateway.</p></blockquote>',14)])])}]])}}]);